            "data_tab_2": "<p><strong>Custom Artwork Creation Time</strong><br/>• Artwork previews will be sent to you via email within 1-3 days.<br/>• Once approved, production will begin within 2-4 business days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shipping Times</strong><br/>Shipping times vary by destination and may increase slightly during peak holiday seasons.<br/>• <strong>USA:</strong> 4–8 business days<br/>• <strong>UK, CA, AUS:</strong> 7–14 business days<br/>• <strong>Europe:</strong> 7–21 business days<br/><em>(All orders are shipped fully tracked)</em></p><p></p><p><strong>Returns & Replacements</strong><br/>Because all of our products are 100% custom-made specifically for your pet, we cannot accept returns or exchanges for a change of mind. However, if your item arrives damaged, has printing errors, or if you receive the wrong product, please let us know. We will gladly arrange a replacement for you immediately—<strong>no questions asked!</strong></p>",
            "name_tab_3": "Satisfaction Guarantee",
            "data_tab_3": "<p>We want you to be absolutely thrilled with your custom art! That is why we make sure you are part of the process from start to finish.</p><p></p><p>We will send you a digital preview of your portrait as soon as it's finished. You can request <strong>unlimited revisions</strong> until the artwork is absolutely perfect. We guarantee that your design will <strong>never</strong> be sent to print until you give us the final thumbs up!</p><p></p><p>Having crafted custom portraits for years and earning thousands of <strong>4.9/5 star reviews</strong>, we truly believe we can deliver the best custom pet artwork you will ever own. Let's create your masterpiece today!</p>"
