          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. Can I see the design before it is printed?",
            "content": "Absolutely! You are part of the creative process. We will send you a digital preview for your approval and will offer unlimited revisions until you are 100% satisfied before we proceed to printing.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_8MMg6p": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. What kind of photo should I provide?",
            "content": "For the best result, please provide a clear, front-facing photo with good lighting (avoid backlighting). Photos taken at your pet's eye level work best. We have a Photo Guide in each listing to help you. If you’re unsure, just send what you have—we’ll help you pick the perfect one!",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_BCVmm6": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. Can you combine pets from separate photos into one portrait?",
            "content": "Yes, we can! If you don't have a photo of your pets together, just send their individual photos. Please try to ensure each photo follows our Photo Guide so the final portrait looks seamless and beautiful.",
            "content_richtext": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_WRqUR4": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. How long does it take to receive my order?",
            "content": "You will receive your digital preview within 1–3 business days. Once you approve the design, production and shipping usually take 4–8 business days. Please note that the timeline may be extended if multiple revisions are requested.",
